---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact & Corrections" description="Contact Dama Workshop, report a calculator error or request a clarification." noindex>
  <section class="legal-hero"><div class="legal-shell"><p class="eyebrow">Contact</p><h1>Corrections make the tools better.</h1><p>If a formula, label, result or explanation appears wrong, send the exact calculator URL, your inputs, expected result and browser.</p></div></section>
  <section class="legal-content"><div class="legal-shell"><h2>Working contact channel</h2><p>Use the public GitHub issue form linked below. It is monitored as the official correction and technical-support channel for this site.</p><p><a class="button" href={SITE.correctionsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open the contact form</a></p><h2>What to include</h2><ul><li>The page URL and calculator name</li><li>Every input exactly as entered</li><li>The result you received and the result you expected</li><li>Whether the issue happened on phone or desktop</li></ul><h2>Response and privacy</h2><p>Do not post private or sensitive information in a public issue. Reports may be used to correct the tool and document the change. We cannot provide project-specific engineering, structural or safety approval.</p><p>For privacy requests, use the same contact channel and begin the title with “Privacy request.”</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
